   SubscriptBox["U", "il"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "91b831d8-e464-42e0-b760-6f6779d3b444"],
 " on the arrows into the hidden units, 2 on the arrows out. The offsets 2",
 Cell[BoxData[
