Cell["\<\
Figure 6.1. The loss during training, on log-log axes. It falls by more than \
six orders of magnitude. The brief spikes near step 5000 are typical of Adam \
with a large step, and the loss recovers within a few steps.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
 FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"167f8dc9-8793-47ff-8091-15d605fc7720"],

